  {/* Story 22.3 — while a tool is on (measuring, the crosshair, a
      snapshot overlay) ONE pill names it and offers "Salir", which turns
      every active tool off (src/lib/map/chrome/tool-pill.ts). It also
      carries the running measurement (#mw-measure-result, moved here from
      its own pill) and the snapshot's Mostrar/Ocultar toggle
      (#mw-snapshot-toggle, moved from the snapshot column), so a
      comparison can be flipped without reopening the menu. Top-centre:
      under the search row on a phone (clear of the rail and the ⋯
      button), in the top bar from sm. */}
